{"v":4,"catch":"讓我們奪回象徵愛與和平的BLUE CRYSTAL ROD！","desc":"《VS.The Quest of Ki》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment）於1988年發行的動作遊戲。\n遊戲的目標是找回被DRUAGA偷走的BLUE CRYSTAL ROD。\n主角KI被控製到達塔頂，那裡有怪物在四處遊蕩。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-11-07","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0913e5108699f569408c3def345daf50e41a4947785db4f48e8a15fb656dc5f1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90ba8f048761f2c040edf8c250e6ab8222b301f6c9ae3db582112107b7d2423b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/aaf98f2244d798b8f39165b13467558d9c7ac96dc71020ac17466f2c1a935b53.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f5778c5a558b2c4f22852bde04b4cc475ef4b3957a2e9f6e8fdaf1695f13b7f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fcacec8fec71063fa5a1eb444af9ba41b00e24571ded00bb568bd2e7c5f48e83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dee12eb103106cbb3016996959aeb766c7e5829c903e4ff81d942d7cc9f3814f.jpg"],"titleId":"01009c80206bc000","dlc":[]}